<hr class="border-border-200 border-t-0.5 my-3 mx-1.5">
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Project Name:</strong> Incorrupt</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Slug:</strong> <code class="bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]">incorrupt</code></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Completion Date:</strong> <em>(to be filled)</em></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>GitHub Link:</strong> <em>(to be filled)</em></p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Tech Stack:</strong> Node.js · Go · MongoDB · Docker · IPFS · Microservices</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Project Summary:</strong>
A decentralized digital evidence management and audit system designed to ensure absolute integrity — no data can be altered without immediate detection. It combines IPFS as an immutable storage layer with a forensic hash chain and distributed consensus across three independent, isolated audit nodes.</p>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Achievements / Features:</strong></p>
<ul class="[li_&amp;]:mb-0 [li_&amp;]:mt-1 [li_&amp;]:gap-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ul]:pb-1 [&amp;:not(:last-child)_ol]:pb-1 list-disc flex flex-col gap-1 pl-8 mb-3">
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Cryptographic hash chain linked per evidence entry</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Mandatory consensus across 3 fully isolated audit nodes</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Immediate tamper detection with no central authority</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Immutable distributed storage via IPFS</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Containerized microservices architecture with Docker</li>
<li class="whitespace-normal break-words pl-2">Node.js API gateway with high-performance Go audit services</li>
</ul>
<p class="font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]"><strong>Detailed Description:</strong>
Incorrupt is a decentralized forensic platform that solves a critical problem in digital evidence management: ensuring that any tampering is immediately detectable. Each submitted piece of evidence generates a cryptographic hash chained to the previous one, forming a hash chain similar to a blockchain but optimized for forensic auditing. Three fully isolated audit nodes independently verify the integrity of each evidence entry — consensus between them is mathematically enforced, eliminating any single point of failure or centralized trust.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="flex justify-start opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100 transition" role="group" aria-label="Message actions"><div class="text-text-300"><div class="text-text-300 flex items-stretch justify-between"><div class="w-fit" data-state="closed"><button class="inline-flex
